classDiagram
%% CDB Finance — Backend: como VSA + Hexagonal se materializam em classes.
%% Fatia vertical exemplar: transactions (feature) sobre o contexto monetary.
%% Toda fatia repete este formato; troque "Transaction" pelo agregado da fatia.
    direction LR

    class TransactionResource {
        <<Feature Resource CDI>>
        so traducao de formato
        +create(userId, TransactionRequest) Response
        +patchStatus(userId, PatchStatusRequest) Response
    }
    class TransactionRequest {
        <<Feature DTO record>>
    }
    class UserUseCase {
        <<Feature UseCase CDI - unico da fatia user>>
        orquestra contexto + servicos de feature
        +createTransaction(userId, Command, categoryId) Result
    }
    class ClosingService {
        <<Feature Policy>>
        +validateDate(userId, date) Result
    }
    class UserTransactionService {
        <<Feature Service>>
        dados overlay da propria fatia
    }
    class ContextBridge {
        <<CDI core - costura CDI/Registry>>
        registra portas no Registry no StartupEvent
    }
    class MonetaryContext {
        <<Facade do contexto>>
        +ucTransaction()$ TransactionUseCase
        +ucAccount()$ AccountUseCase
    }
    class TransactionUseCase {
        <<UseCase aplicacao>>
        +execute(Command) Result
    }
    class TransactionService {
        <<Service aplicacao>>
        parametros simples, valida dominio
    }
    class MonetaryTransaction {
        <<Domain Model record>>
    }
    class TransactionRepository {
        <<Porta interface dominio>>
        +save(MonetaryTransaction) Result
    }
    class TransactionJDBCRepository {
        <<Adaptador infra JDBC-H2>>
    }
    class Registry {
        <<Service Locator commons>>
    }
    class Result {
        <<Success ou Failure>>
        +map()
        +flatMap()
        +recover()
        +get()
    }

    TransactionResource ..> TransactionRequest : recebe DTO
    TransactionResource ..> UserUseCase : delega TODA a orquestracao
    TransactionResource ..> Result : traduz em HTTP na borda
    UserUseCase ..> ClosingService : politica validada na FRONTEIRA da feature
    UserUseCase ..> UserTransactionService : logica local da fatia
    UserUseCase ..> MonetaryContext : use case do contexto via acessor estatico
    MonetaryContext ..> TransactionUseCase : resolve no Registry - tryGet
    TransactionUseCase ..> TransactionService : orquestra
    TransactionUseCase ..> Result : retorna
    TransactionService ..> TransactionRepository : usa a PORTA
    TransactionService ..> MonetaryTransaction : opera o modelo
    TransactionRepository <|.. TransactionJDBCRepository : adaptador implementa
    ContextBridge ..> Registry : liga porta ao adaptador no startup

    note for TransactionResource "VSA: o Resource so traduz formato.\nOrquestracao mora no UserUseCase.\nProibido acessar repositorio de contexto."
    note for MonetaryContext "Hexagonal: contexto livre de framework.\nDI via Registry, nunca CDI/Spring.\nFacade expoe os use cases (estatico)."
    note for Result "Railway: sem excecao para fluxo de negocio.\nErro de dominio e objeto de valor."
